<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Hold (spell)</h1>
<p>Sphere: Mind Sphere
Class: none (no guild teaches it)
Mana: 20
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast hold &lt;target&gt;
</pre>
<p>Magic engulfs a humanoid or a mammal, leaving it unable to fight: it 
misses its next five combat rounds, and it can't flee in panic meanwhile. 
It has no effect on other creatures, such as birds, reptiles, insects or 
the undead (for those, see hold animal, hold monster and hold undead).
</p><p>The target resists with its mind, and the spell is very difficult: it 
fails quite often. Casting it is an attack, so it starts a fight with the 
target whether it works or not. You can cast it while fighting. It is also 
found on wands, scrolls and potions.
</p><p>For the hold command, holding something in your hand, see <a cmd='#'>Help Hold</a>.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
